"\u003eQ.S. to 6.5-7.5\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e계\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTotal\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e100.00\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e제조 공정 (PROCEDURE)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e정제수(DI Water)에 Solagum™ AX를 분산시킨 후 Phase A의 나머지 원료들을 투입하여 혼합함.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003ePhase A를 \u003cstrong\u003e80°C\u003c/strong\u003e까지 가열함.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003ePhase C 성분들을 배합하고 스피드믹서(SpeedMixer)를 사용하여 안료를 균일하게 분산시킴.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003ePhase C에 Phase B 원료들을 투입하고 \u003cstrong\u003e80°C\u003c/strong\u003e까지 가열함.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e가열된 Phase A에 Phase B/C 혼합물을 투입하고 호모게나이저로 \u003cstrong\u003e4,500 rpm에서 3분간 균질화\u003c/strong\u003e함.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e배치를 프로펠러 믹서로 옮기고 교반하면서 \u003cstrong\u003e45°C\u003c/strong\u003e로 냉각함.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \t\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003ePhase D(Citric Acid 25%)를 사용하여 최종 제형의 \u003cstrong\u003epH를 6.5 - 7.5\u003c/strong\u003e로 조정하여 완료함.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e물성 규격 및 보관 안정성 (PHYSICAL PROPERTIES \u0026amp; STABILITY)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e• \u003cstrong\u003epH (@ 25°C)\u003c/strong\u003e: \u003cstrong\u003e6.5 - 7.5\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e• \u003cstrong\u003e점도 (@ 25°C)\u003c/strong\u003e: \u003cstrong\u003e55,000 - 65,000 cps\u003c/strong\u003e (Brookfield RTV; Spindle T-C @ 10 rpm)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e보관 안정성 (STABILITY)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e◦ 45°C 조건에서 8주 안정 통과\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e◦ 50°C 조건에서 4주 안정 통과\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e◦ 동결-융해(Freeze/Thaw) 3사이클 통과\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n \u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;\"\u003e[처방 가이드라인 및 면책 고지 (Disclaimer)]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e1. 연구·개발(R\u0026amp;D) 참고용 한정: 본 처방 데이터는 화장품 제형 개발을 위한 참고용 가이드이며,\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e완제품의 효능, 안전성, 안정성 및 유통 기한을 보증하지 않습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e2. 사전 테스트 및 검증 책임: 실제 양산 적용 전, 개발사 및 제조사의 책임 하에 충분한 예비 실험,\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e상용화 테스트, 제형 안정성 및 방부력 테스트를 거쳐야 합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e3. 규제 및 법규 준수: 원료별 배합 한도, 수출 대상국(국내 식약처, FDA, EU CPNP, NMPA 등)의\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e화장품 관련 법규 및 최신 규제 사항은 개발사가 직접 사전 검토·확인해야 합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e4. 지식재산권 및 법적 책임 한계: 본 처방에 포함된 일부 원료 조합 및 정보는 외부 원료사의\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e가이드에 기반하고 있으며, 이와 관련된 특허권, 지식재산권 저촉 여부 및 본 처방 활용으로 인해\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e발생하는 제품의 물리적·화학적·법적 문제에 대한 모든 책임은 전적으로 이를 활용하여 제품을\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e개발·생산하는 개발 주체(고객사)에게 있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003c!-- 동적 수신자 연동 팝업 폼 시작 --\u003e\n\u003c!-- 동적 수신자 연동 팝업 폼 끝 --\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\u003c/div\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003c/div\u003e\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\u003cdiv class=\"kboard-document-action\"\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003cdiv class=\"right\"\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003cbutton type=\"button\" class=\"kboard-button-action kboard-button-print\" onclick=\"kboard_document_print(\u0027https://wordpress-1663666-6630820.cloudwaysapps.com/?action=kboard_document_print\u0026uid=213\u0027)\" title=\"인쇄\"\u003e인쇄\u003c/button\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\u003c/div\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003c/div\u003e\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003c/div\u003e\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t",
